{"chapter": "schemes", "node_kind": "paragraph", "parent_tag": "01KH", "placeholders": {"MATH_0001": "$X$", "MATH_0002": "$\\Delta \\subset X \\times X$", "MATH_0003": "$X$", "MATH_0004": "$S$", "MATH_0005": "$$\n\\Delta_{X/S} : X \\longrightarrow X \\times_S X.\n$$", "MATH_0006": "$\\text{pr}_1 \\circ \\Delta_{X/S} = \\text{id}_X$", "MATH_0007": "$\\text{pr}_2 \\circ \\Delta_{X/S} = \\text{id}_X$", "STRUCT_0001": "\\noindent"}, "render": {"prefix": "", "suffix": ""}, "risk_level": "R2", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:d2e5e19503a52dd2df402ed26cba39eff88a471a4fe8bb18b50dbe22ad1e74f8", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:8d599b3fe3a83c2c8d9bb9324e4454724b2a6abefd2d5ec9ff19ec497a066e14", "source_text": "\n\n<STRUCT_0001>\nA topological space <MATH_0001> is Hausdorff if and only if the\ndiagonal <MATH_0002> is a closed subset.\nThe analogue in algebraic geometry is, given a scheme <MATH_0003> over\na base scheme <MATH_0004>, to consider the\ndiagonal morphism\n<MATH_0005>\nThis is the unique morphism of schemes such that\n<MATH_0006> and\n<MATH_0007> (it exists in\nany category with fibre products).\n\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:ad12901d92de7bbddb32a1ae03b7d2e319632de2b3cab40a2f9e90a68a5c05d3", "unit_id": "tag:01KH:prose-0001"}
{"chapter": "schemes", "node_kind": "lemma", "parent_tag": "01KH", "placeholders": {}, "render": {"prefix": "\\begin{lemma}\n\\label{lemma-diagonal-affines-closed}\n", "suffix": "\\end{lemma}"}, "risk_level": "R3", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:44136fa355b3678a1146ad16f7e8649e94fb4fc21fe77e8310c060f61caaff8a", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:93eab49823b3dbac5eb63d24e7f87234e0ad0f1c18fe8a37cec1ba4ae1823795", "source_text": "The diagonal morphism of a morphism between affines is closed.\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:9a045e8fb49fb9c6fd0543e9605c2f7505313fe3d35add834e6f10ebbebf0250", "unit_id": "tag:01KI:statement"}
